  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The length of one side of square M is <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math> times the length of one side of square N. The area of square N is <math alttext=\"49\"><mn>49</mn>\n</math> square feet. What is the area, in square feet, of square M?</p>",
